Package: bfguard
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: BFGuard Maintainers <maintainers@bfguard.local>
Depends: nftables
Homepage: https://example.com/bfguard
Description: Brute-force protection daemon using nftables
 bfguard listens on configured TCP/UDP ports and automatically
 blacklists remote IP addresses in nftables to protect against
 brute-force attacks. It manages IPv4/IPv6 blacklist sets and
 installs base security rules (dropping packets with invalid
 connection state).
